# The Details screen (C9): `monkeyc -f "monkey.jungle;detalhes.jungle"`, only through
# `tools/sim.py shots --detalhes`. It is the demo (`demo.jungle`) without `DemoHold`: swaps
# the `demoAfterLoad` that holds the screen (`demo/source/DemoHold.mc`, annotated
# `demo_hold`) for the one in `demo/detalhes/DetalhesStart.mc`, which walks the bike to the
# middle of the route, opens Details and notifies `sim.py`, which photographs the simulator.
base.sourcePath = source;demo/source;demo/detalhes
base.resourcePath = resources;demo/resources
base.excludeAnnotations = canary;quadratic_parse;nodemo;demo_hold;no_near_alert
